# Rows (135, 7) and (322, 14) hold a hyphenated compound that dstext now joins across
# Capcom's newline ("muddle-headed", "evidence-tamperer"; HYPHEN_NL_FIX): their hash and
# 'want' are keyed to the stream with that rule applied, which has one space unit fewer, so
